1
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,760
Hey, Yu-Gi-Oh, isn't that the 430 bell?

2
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:22,470
Uh...

3
00:00:22,553 --> 00:00:23,980
Yeah, it is.

4
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,020
They're both late.

5
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,101
That's not good.

6
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:30,207
Rownie and Tiese have
never been late before.

7
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:36,300
I got a bad feeling about this.

8
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:44,597
I'm gonna go over to their dorm
and see if they're still there.

9
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:48,757
They might be on their way over, so
hold down the port till I get back.

10
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,557
Wait, why are you going out that way?

11
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:51,470
Use a door...

12
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:56,020
I wish he'd stop using the window.

13
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:13,640
Thank goodness, we were...

14
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:21,880
Would you happen to be a
lead disciple, Yu-Gi-Oh?

15
00:01:22,360 --> 00:01:24,260
Yes, and you are?

16
00:01:24,860 --> 00:01:28,457
My name is Frenika Seski,
one of the primary trainees.

17
00:01:28,540 --> 00:01:32,177
I do apologize for coming to see
you without an appointment, sir.

18
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:33,300
I need your help.

19
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:36,300
I don't know who else
to ask. It's alright.

20
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:37,935
Tell me what's wrong.

21
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:44,420
I know you've gone above and beyond in
regards to my issue with Lord Zizek.

22
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:47,664
I really can't even begin
to thank you for that.

23
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:54,897
Unfortunately, tonight I received
word from him that I am too...

24
00:01:54,980 --> 00:02:00,800
That is, he ordered me to perform a service
that I'm much too embarrassed to repeat.

25
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:08,860
I told Ronier and Tiese that if he
kept giving me orders like this,

26
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:11,473
there's no way I'd be able to stay here.

27
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,460
I'd have to leave the academy.

28
00:02:14,180 --> 00:02:15,010
me.

29
00:02:15,093 --> 00:02:16,080
When I told them all this,

30
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:20,182
they said they'd go try to reason
with him, but they still haven't

31
00:02:22,060 --> 00:02:22,890
come back.

32
00:02:22,973 --> 00:02:24,257
I'm afraid of what that could mean.

33
00:02:24,340 --> 00:02:25,277
So am I.

34
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,889
Stay here till I get back.

35
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:31,896
So this is how they want to get even.

36
00:02:31,980 --> 00:02:33,980
By hurting Ronie and Tiese.

37
00:03:01,260 --> 00:03:03,857
But when we reach out
we break it We take it

38
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:32,360
SHINING SOMER DIAMOND

39
00:04:13,380 --> 00:04:15,080
Please, enter.

40
00:04:27,700 --> 00:04:33,160
We just uncorked this 50-year-old bottle
from the Western Empire. Do join us.

41
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,860
Commoners never taste such delights.

42
00:04:43,580 --> 00:04:45,400
I'm afraid I must decline.

43
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:47,840
Another matter brings me here.

44
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,060
I'd like to know if my page,

45
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:54,260
Primary Trainee Tze Streenan,
and Disciple Kirito's page,

46
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:56,620
Primary Trainee Ronie Arabelle?

47
00:04:56,860 --> 00:04:58,213
came here this evening.

48
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,480
I see.

49
00:05:00,540 --> 00:05:04,857
What a coincidence that those two girls
belong to Sir Kirito and yourself.

50
00:05:04,940 --> 00:05:07,740
Their audaciousness was rather surprising.

51
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:11,840
Approaching such highly regarded
students as Umber and myself,

52
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:14,760
and without so much as
a formal invitation,

53
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:17,300
their lack of couth is familiar.

54
00:05:20,700 --> 00:05:23,200
That said, they do need to be careful.

55
00:05:23,860 --> 00:05:27,160
Assertiveness can sometimes
be construed as disrespect.

56
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,946
Do not agree, Disciple Eugeo.

57
00:05:31,520 --> 00:05:34,440
We can talk about your
opinions another time.

58
00:05:34,940 --> 00:05:37,352
I want to know where Tiese and Ronie are!

59
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:05,020
What is this?

60
00:06:11,060 --> 00:06:13,360
