as a means to satisfy my lustful urges.

68
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:42,760
After everything I've done to try to
guide Fernika down the proper path,

69
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:44,374
talk about ungrateful.

70
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,900
But lo and behold, the plot doth thicken.

71
00:06:48,380 --> 00:06:51,657
They made the preposterous
claim that as Umber's roommate,

72
00:06:51,740 --> 00:06:54,799
I was just as responsible
for his actions as he was.

73
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:58,520
The idea of someone like her asking me,

74
00:06:58,740 --> 00:07:02,799
the eldest of a third-ranked household,
Have you no honor as a noble?

75
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,842
Have you ever heard such lunacy?

76
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:12,460
Sir, even if everything
happened as you described?

77
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:15,437
Tying them up and locking
them in your bedroom,

78
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:18,755
that goes way beyond your
authority to punish trainees!

79
00:07:19,100 --> 00:07:21,537
You're referring to the school guidelines?

80
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:25,520
My dear Eugeo, you need to
think much larger than that.

81
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:28,517
Do you remember this passage
from the Academy's rules?

82
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:31,340
Higher Law takes precedence in all cases.

83
00:07:35,140 --> 00:07:39,680
Higher Law refers to the Taboo
Index as well as basic Imperial Law.

84
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,020
In other words,

85
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:44,477
what I can exercise on these
girls of lower rank isn't

86
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:47,501
a result of authority given
to me by this academy,

87
00:07:47,620 --> 00:07:49,340
but my power as a noble!

88
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:54,620
Such is my sovereign right!

89
00:07:56,340 --> 00:08:00,760
Stop your squirming and take
your punishment like a good girl.

90
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:11,840
Leave him alone!

91
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:13,668
Hold your ground, commoner.

92
00:08:14,380 --> 00:08:17,257
This judgment is being
carried out in complete

93
00:08:17,340 --> 00:08:20,877
accordance with basic imperial
law and the taboo index.

94
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:25,360
To obstruct such a decree
would be deemed a criminal act.

95
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:30,661
If you take even one step closer, you will
become a criminal in the eyes of the law.

96
00:08:30,900 --> 00:08:32,340
You can't do this!

97
00:08:34,500 --> 00:08:35,520
My legs!

98
00:08:39,380 --> 00:08:40,940
No! Please, no!

99
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:50,560
No! No!

100
00:08:51,120 --> 00:09:01,710
No!

101
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,960
No! No!

102
00:09:05,820 --> 00:09:10,540
There are things you just shouldn't do,
even if there's no law against them.

103
00:09:10,940 --> 00:09:14,920
At the same time, there
might be stuff you should do,

104
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:17,219
even if the laws say you shouldn't.

105
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:28,380
No! Stop! Please!

106
00:09:29,540 --> 00:09:32,440
Yu-Gi-Oh! Help me! Please!

107
00:09:32,820 --> 00:09:33,780
I'm begging you!

108
00:09:33,980 --> 00:09:35,380
Don't let him do this!

109
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:40,340
Ronie and Tiese had the courage
to stand up for their friend!

110
00:09:40,940 --> 00:09:43,705
What kind of law justifies
punishment for that?

111
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:47,912
Ryo's and Umber are going to defile them.

112
00:09:48,260 --> 00:09:51,000
What kind of law does
nothing to stop them?

113
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:57,520
If upholding laws like
these is my duty, then...

114
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:01,220
Then I...

115
00:10:02,220 --> 00:10:03,050
I...

116
00:10:16,260 --> 00:10:18,760
What's going on?

117
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:21,720
Wait, this happened before.

118
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:27,240
This is evil.

119
00:10:27,680 --> 00:10:28,860
I have to...

120
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,680
Stop them!

121
00:10:34,200 --> 00:10:37,260
Help us! Please! Yadier!

122
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:10,660
My arm.

123
00:11:10,940 --> 00:11:13,220
My arm is bleeding. Help!

124
00:11:13,780 --> 00:11:14,839
It's not stopping.

125
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:17,080
My life is decreasing.

126
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:21,540
Please, Lord Raios, use
the sacred arts. No, wait.

127
00:11:21,780 --> 00:11:23,777
A normal spell won't heal this in time.

128
00:11:23,860 --> 00:11:26,684
Life energy, hurry, share
some of yours with me.

129
00:11:36,060 --> 00:11:37,380
What a thrill.

130
00:11:38,300 --> 00:11:42,420
Never before have I witnessed
someone commit such a heinous crime.

131
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:48,437
The scope of a noble's
authority only applies to

132
