run-of-the-mill plebeian scum.

133
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:57,580
But for rogues who've broken the
taboo index, exceptions can be made.

134
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:06,477
I've never used my sword to
cut off someone's head before.

135
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:09,420
I will gain even more power from it.

136
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:12,820
You are no disciple now.

137
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:15,620
No, you are a criminal.

138
00:12:16,100 --> 00:12:20,100
In accordance with the powers granted
to me as a third-ranked noble,

139
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:23,680
I, Rios Antinous, shall execute you!

140
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:40,650
Kirito...

141
00:12:40,733 --> 00:12:41,860
Back off, Raios.

142
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:44,540
No way am I gonna let you hurt him.

143
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:49,760
Good of you to join the
party, Disciple Kirito.

144
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:53,040
However, I'm afraid
you're a hair too late.

145
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:56,848
This filthy swine violated the
Taboo Index and is a criminal.

146
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:59,120
So you best stand down.

147
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:04,177
I shall cut his head from his neck, just
like the heads of your precious flowers.

148
00:13:04,260 --> 00:13:07,700
I don't give a damn about
your taboos or noble crap.

149
00:13:08,140 --> 00:13:11,669
Eugio's a friend of mine, but
you, you're less than nothing.

150
00:13:11,860 --> 00:13:14,600
You're even lower than
the goddamn goblins.

151
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:26,460
To think that not one, but two peasants
would commit such heinous crimes.

152
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:30,191
This means I can do away with
both of you at the same time.

153
00:13:30,580 --> 00:13:32,517
What a joyous day this is.

154
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:36,160
Surely this is a divine blessing
from the goddess Stacia!

155
00:13:49,600 --> 00:13:50,430
I got this.

156
00:14:06,860 --> 00:14:10,520
That piece of junk will shatter
against my secret technique!

157
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:12,035
We'll see about that!

158
00:14:32,740 --> 00:14:35,340
Well now, how is that?

159
00:14:35,780 --> 00:14:38,060
You can't possibly have thought I,

160
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:42,460
