against a pissant like you!

161
00:14:48,580 --> 00:14:49,480
Kirito...

162
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,560
My arms!

163
00:15:17,140 --> 00:15:18,660
What have you done?

164
00:15:19,140 --> 00:15:21,140
The blood, it won't stop!

165
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:25,490
Bumper!

166
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:26,910
Hurry!

167
00:15:27,100 --> 00:15:28,500
Make the bleeding stop!

168
00:15:29,060 --> 00:15:32,360
