169
00:15:32,920 --> 00:15:34,140
I can't do that!

170
00:15:34,380 --> 00:15:36,940
If I untie this, my
life will be decreased!

171
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:39,940
You can't ask me to
violate the Taboo Index!

172
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,320
Hang the law!

173
00:15:41,680 --> 00:15:42,620
Help me!

174
00:15:42,860 --> 00:15:44,000
It's not stopping!

175
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:45,790
Umber!

176
00:15:46,260 --> 00:15:47,640
Taboo! You must!

177
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,120
My life!

178
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:50,560
My life is...

179
00:15:52,560 --> 00:15:53,390
Taboo!

180
00:15:53,660 --> 00:15:56,580
My life! The blood! Taboo!

181
00:15:59,580 --> 00:16:00,920
My life!

182
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:02,160
My blood!

183
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:03,840
The taboo!

184
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:05,100
My life!

185
00:16:05,540 --> 00:16:06,640
The taboo!

186
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:10,270
Life!

187
00:16:10,353 --> 00:16:11,183
The taboo!

188
00:16:11,266 --> 00:16:12,096
Life!

189
00:16:12,179 --> 00:16:13,600
I'll tie him off for you.

190
00:16:14,900 --> 00:16:16,017
My life!

191
00:16:16,100 --> 00:16:17,540
Taboo! Blood!

192
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:18,620
Taboo!

193
00:16:44,340 --> 00:16:45,580
What the hell?

194
00:16:46,280 --> 00:16:48,162
What happened to his Fluctlight?

195
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:53,880
What have you done to him?

196
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:55,660
He's...

197
00:16:57,700 --> 00:16:58,620
Murderer!

198
00:16:59,460 --> 00:17:00,380
Monster!

199
00:17:01,360 --> 00:17:02,190
Monster!

200
00:17:09,900 --> 00:17:11,480
I'm so sorry.

201
00:17:14,320 --> 00:17:16,640
Please forgive me, Eugeo.

202
00:17:17,360 --> 00:17:18,277
This is...

203
00:17:18,360 --> 00:17:19,700
This is all my fault.

204
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:21,660
No, it's not.

205
00:17:21,880 --> 00:17:24,420
You're not to blame for this. I am.

206
00:17:24,900 --> 00:17:27,657
This happened because I
didn't think it through.

207
00:17:27,740 --> 00:17:31,180
It isn't your fault,
Tiese. But... Yu-Gi-Oh.

208
00:17:32,300 --> 00:17:33,130
You're right.

209
00:17:33,380 --> 00:17:36,500
All that matters now is that
you and Trainee are safe.

210
00:17:37,040 --> 00:17:38,840
I wish I got here sooner.

211
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:40,560
I'm sorry.

212
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:42,880
It's my fault this all happened.

213
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:14,880
I've seen this before,
somewhere a long time ago.

214
00:18:17,340 --> 00:18:18,597
Hold on to her.

215
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:19,915
Don't let her see it!

216
00:18:20,540 --> 00:18:23,220
A singular unit has been detected.

217
00:18:23,560 --> 00:18:25,020
Tracing its ID.

218
00:18:25,980 --> 00:18:27,380
Coordinates fixed.

219
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:29,220
Report complete.

220
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:46,690
Murder!

221
00:18:46,773 --> 00:18:47,660
Monster!

222
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:49,660
He's right.

223
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,000
What am I?

224
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:53,660
I'm no better than those couplins.

225
00:18:59,740 --> 00:19:01,217
No, Eugeo. You're human.

226
00:19:01,300 --> 00:19:02,320
Same as me.

227
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:07,035
Sure, sometimes we screw up, but we
can learn from it and make it right.

228
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:08,338
That's being human.

229
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:10,550
